\section{Methods}
\label{sec:methods}

The determination of the Feynman rules to be presented in Chapters \ref{sec:SMInteractions} and \ref{sec:LQInteractions} is carried out using the Mathematica package FeynRules 2.3.36~\cite{Alloul:2013bka}. All model files and the Mathematica notebook needed to display and export the Feynman rules can be found online at GitLab. In the following, the structure of the code files will be discussed. For more information about FeynRules, the interested reader is referred to Ref.~\cite{Alloul:2013bka}.

